<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed all four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.639  bln pesos  7 days   29.50  29.39  29.46    4    2</p>
<p>1.639  bln pesos  6 days   29.42  29.38  29.40    4    3</p>
<p>1.639  bln pesos  3 days   29.35  29.31  29.33    3    3</p>
<p>2.000  bln pesos  1 day    29.31  29.18  29.27    4    4</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
